.TH "Docv::Viewer::Dock" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Viewer::Dock \- The dock left of the page: the search field on its first row, then a tree of pages (nested \fB\%Picker\fRs the viewer sets: the current page\(aqs group, or every page during a manual search), with a divider on its right edge that resizes it and joins the lines above and below the content.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Viewer::Dock\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The dock left of the page: the search field on its first row, then a
tree of pages (nested \fB\%Picker\fRs the viewer sets: the current page\(aqs
group, or every page during a manual search), with a divider on its
right edge that resizes it and joins the lines above and below the
content. A \fB\%Regular\fR dock narrows the page (\fB\%Frame#dock\fR); an
\fB\%Overlay\fR dock covers its left part, on \fB\%Popup\fR.
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
