 \[u25D6] /abrt          \[u25D7] \[u2502]
 \[u25BE] abrt             \[u2502]
     abrt(1)        \[u2502]
   \[u25B8] action         \[u2502]
\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2500]\[u2534]
.EE
.RE
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBFIELD_LEFT = \(aq\[u25D6]\(aq\fR
The ends of the search field, drawn in the field\(aqs background color.
.TP 4
\fBFIELD_MARGIN = 1\fR
Blank columns on either side of the field.
.PP
\fBFIELD_RIGHT = \(aq\[u25D7]\(aq\fR
.TP 4
\fBHEAD_ROWS = 1\fR
Rows above the tree: the field.
.TP 4
\fBMANUAL_PREFIX = \(aq/\(aq\fR
Typed first, searches the manual instead of the page.
.PP
\fBMIN_PAGE = 20\fR
.TP 4
\fBMIN_WIDTH = 16\fR
Narrowest dock, and the columns it leaves the page at least.
.TP 4
\fBPLACEHOLDER = "find"\fR
Shown in the field while it is empty and not focused.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(width : Int32 = ViewerSettings.new.dock_width, style : DockStyle = DockStyle::Regular, open : Bool = false)\fR
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.tail(text : String, width : Int32) : String\fR
The end of \fItext\fR that fits in \fIwidth\fR columns, after a \fB\%\[u2026]\fR when cut.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef draw(screen : Screen, frame : Frame, styles : Array(UInt16), focused : Bool, hover : Int32 | Nil, dragging : Bool) : Nil\fR
Draws the open dock on \fIframe\fR with the role style ids \fIstyles\fR: the
field (its text with a cursor when \fIfocused\fR, a leading \fB\%/\fR in
\fB\%Prompt\fR, otherwise the placeholder), the divider in \fB\%Border\fR
(\fB\%Thumb\fR while \fIdragging\fR) joining the lines above and below with
\fB\%\[u252C]\fR and \fB\%\[u2534]\fR, and the tree with the visible row \fIhover\fR (with details
in a manual search). An overlay dock is drawn on \fB\%Popup\fR.
.PP
\fBdef field : Docv::Viewer::Field\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef group : Picker | Nil\fR
The tree of the current page\(aqs group (or of the folder\(aqs pages).
.TP 4
\fBdef group=(group : Picker | Nil)\fR
The tree of the current page\(aqs group (or of the folder\(aqs pages).
.TP 4
\fBdef manual? : Bool\fR
True when the field holds a manual search (a leading \fB\%/\fR).
.TP 4
\fBdef offset(cols : Int32) : Int32\fR
Columns the page moves right on a screen of \fIcols\fR columns: the span
of an open regular dock.
.PP
\fBdef open=(open : Bool)\fR
.PP
\fBdef open? : Bool\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef pages : Picker | Nil\fR
The tree of every page, for manual searches.
.TP 4
\fBdef pages=(pages : Picker | Nil)\fR
The tree of every page, for manual searches.
.TP 4
\fBdef part(frame : Frame, row : Int32, col : Int32) : Part | Nil\fR
The part of the open dock at screen cell (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR), if any.
.TP 4
\fBdef query : String\fR
The query of the field: after the prefix of a manual search.
.TP 4
\fBdef span(cols : Int32) : Int32\fR
Columns the dock takes on a screen of \fIcols\fR columns, leaving the
page \fB\%MIN_PAGE\fR columns when there is room.
.PP
\fBdef style : DockStyle\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef tree : Picker | Nil\fR
The tree shown: every page during a manual search, otherwise the
current page\(aqs group.
.TP 4
\fBdef tree_cols(frame : Frame) : Int32\fR
Columns of the tree on \fIframe\fR (the divider excluded).
.TP 4
\fBdef tree_row(frame : Frame, row : Int32) : Int32 | Nil\fR
The visible tree row at screen \fIrow\fR, if the row is in the tree.
.TP 4
\fBdef tree_rows(frame : Frame) : Int32\fR
Rows of the tree on \fIframe\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef width : Int32\fR
Width in columns, divider included, before it is fitted to a screen
(\fB\%span\fR).
.TP 4
\fBdef width=(width : Int32) : Int32\fR
Sets the width, at least \fB\%MIN_WIDTH\fR.
